            "text": "<p>Our Haritaki is produced in a <strong>GMP-certified facility</strong>, meaning:</p><ul><li>Strict quality control at every stage<br/></li><li>Verified ingredient handling and sourcing<br/></li><li>Controlled production environments<br/></li><li>Batch-level traceability<br/></li><li>Consistent potency and purity<br/></li></ul><p>GMP certification is one of the highest standards in supplement manufacturing.</p>",
